 Gun and its four functions \"Shoot\", \"Pull\", \"Return\" and \"Bomb\" to help you overcome these obstacles. Conquer all the grids and become the grid master!", "short_description": "Destroy all the tile-shaped targets (BITs) floating in the cubic space named \"GRID\".\nTo break a BIT, shoot it using your Grid Gun.\nHowever, conquering the innumerable Grids in the digital space will not be straight forward as there are multiple obstacles that will hinder your progress.\nUse the Grid Gun and its four functions \"Shoot\", \"Pull\", \"Return\" and \"Bomb\" to help you overcome these obstacles. Conquer all the grids and become the grid master!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.super-appli.co.jp/en/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.super-appli.co.jp/en/termsofuse", "publisher_name": "SuperAppli Inc", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.super-appli.co.jp/en/grid-ball", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1592192974313489"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ARCADE", "ACTION", "SHOOTER"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "ja"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "969288590690021"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 0, "nodes": []}, "baseline_offer": null, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": []}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "5083894718361633", "version": "1.55"}, "